1
00:00:02,090 --> 00:00:07,620
Quick Trade lets you trade with a single click. Turn it on with this button, or Alt+Q.

2
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:11,980
A lot size column appears on every row. Use minus and plus to change it.

3
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:20,770
If the names are cut off, drag the edge to make the watchlist wider.

4
00:00:20,870 --> 00:00:28,510
Now one click on the Ask buys straight away, and one click on the Bid sells. There is no ticket.

5
00:00:28,610 --> 00:00:33,230
The position opens at once.

6
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:39,350
Closing is instant too: Close Position closes it with no confirmation.

7
00:00:39,450 --> 00:00:43,440
So use Quick Trade with care. Click the button again to turn it off.

